    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 18">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 18</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa on cease éacniende wif gewerde, bete þone æwerdlan, swa him domeras gereccen. Gif hio dead sie, selle sawle wið sawle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone in the course of a quarrel should injure a pregnant woman, let him compensate for the damage as the judges may counsel for him. If she should die, give soul for soul.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa on ceaste eacniende wif gewerde, bete þone æwyrdlan, swa him demeras gereccan. Gif heo dæd sy, sylle sawle wið sawle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
